{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43611","headline":"寒夜文宴联句 · 皮日休","name":"寒夜文宴联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"文星今夜聚，应在斗牛间。\n载石人方至，乘槎客未还。\n送觞繁露曲，徵句白云颜。\n节奏惟听竹，从容只话山。\n理穷倾秘藏，论猛折玄关。\n酃酒分中绿，巴笺擘处殷。\n清言闻後醒，强韵压来艰。\n犀柄当风揖，琼枝向月攀。\n松吟方㗫㗫，泉梦忆潺潺。\n一会文章草，昭明不可删。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43611.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43611","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}